window.products.push({"id":223025,"name":"Rice Hydro 32 Inch Heavy Duty Choker-Style Post Puller Set with Lifting Chain Puller | Wood Post Puller for Round Fence Posts, Sign Post & Tree Stump ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":165.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cGmvY7pcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"WOOD FENCE POST PULLER - This post hole puller set comes with a 42” long chain and 32\" standing frame with lever that removes different types of metal or wooden fence posts from the ground with maximum leverage and minimum effort. FENCE REMOVAL & MORE - Our post puller set comes with a 42” long, choker-style chain attachment that wraps around large obstructions. Use it to remove fence stakes, split rail fencing post, shrubs, and tree stumps in no time. EASY TO USE & STORE - The puller tools set has less parts than the typical stump puller equipment or ground rod puller, which reduces common pinch points and makes it easier to use and conveniently store. It features a standing frame secured to a balanced 6\" x 6\" platform base that adds extra power and security needed to complete a big job. USA-MADE DURABLE POWDER COATED & WELDED STEEL - Our expertly designed fence puller frame is forged from heavy duty, USA welded steel. It’s finished with a powder coat that protects it from chipping, rusting, or enduring weather damage. Even with heavy use and hasty storage, our high quality fence tools will continue to work like new. INTERCHANGEABLE FENCE PULL CHAIN - Our fence post remover is compatible with both a choker-style chain or a tee post style chain (sold separately). Simply attach the chain puller tool style of your choice to the shorter end of the leverage pole and it's ready to use!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cGmvY7pcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RICE Hydro, Inc","source_asin":"B07GQ38121","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-223025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GQ38121","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GQ38121","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":223026,"name":"Totally Bamboo 15-Inch Paddle Board","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YEF5ovznS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This original paddle board design is a new entry into the beloved Totally Bamboo Hawaiian Collection, boasting practicality and style. The 15\" Paddle Board natural colored, opposing grain end cap and handle, giving the board a fetching aesthetic look and prevents warping with its unique design. With its expansive size and grip, the 15\" Paddle Board is perfect for cutting food and handling large items. Dim. 15¼\" x 8\" x ¾\" No stains or paint are used to create the Paddle Board's scrumptious Honey shade. This color is created in a very specialized heating process which caramelizes the natural sugar in the wood; it is permanent and will not fade or wash out. Care: wash with warm water and mild detergent and occasionally wipe with mineral oil (Do not clean in the dishwasher). An Ecological wonder, Bamboo is a grass that grows to a harvestable height of 60 feet in 3 to 5 years. It has an extensive root system that continually develops new shoots thus not requiring replanting making it an incredible self-renewing resource and a brilliant alternative to the wide spread clear cutting of our world's hard wood forests. Do the world a favor¿ Do Bamboo.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YEF5ovznS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Totally Bamboo","source_asin":"B000O5EU9S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-223026","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000O5EU9S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000O5EU9S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
