window.products.push({"id":223142,"name":"SYACOT 40 oz Stainless Steel Water Bottle, Insulated Double Wall Vacuum Leak Proof Water Flask, Metal Thermo Canteen Mug —Wide Mouth with 2 Straw Lids","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512+xr5c+nL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Vacuum Insulated】- Bottle is made from premium gauge 18/8 stainless steel and is powder coated in a durable matte finish.. The exterior of the vacuum sealed area is dipped in copper for added insulation. Copper reduces the transfer of temperature, adding even more insulation to your bottle. 【New Straw Lid】The design of the dust cover has been added.using the dust cover to open the nozzle is easier than the traditional opening method, the dust cover can effectively prevent dust from entering, and avoid touching the nozzle by hand, which is more convenient and sanitary. Wide mouth makes it easy to clean, BPA-free lid which means they are very safe.2 lids can be switched at any time, Matching of different colors to suit different occasions 【Easy to Use】- Take this easy to carry portable water bottle while hiking, biking, shopping or leave it at the office. While sitting anywhere in any temperature condition, It keeps your drink COLD for up to 24 hours, and HOT for up to 12 hours 【Easy to Carry】- Built for easy drinking on the go, the lid is leak proof when the nozzle is in the closed position. you can easily carry the reusable water bottle to anywhere you like. The SYACOT water bottle is a great gift for any occasion. 【Ideal Gift Choice】- Coming with 40oz large capacity; The mouth is wide enough to fit ice cubes, also easy to clean. Choose between the most popular and durable powder coated colors on the market, The Powder Coat works with the premium insulation, which prevents condensation from forming on the outside of the bottle; durable soft handle design and lightweight design, this excellent bottle is the best present idea for your friends and family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512+xr5c+nL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SYACOT","source_asin":"B08X1K82NL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-223142","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X1K82NL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X1K82NL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
