window.products.push({"id":223202,"name":"Pillivuyt Lion's Head Tureen with Lid, 3.5 Quart","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wbvYcLIQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pillivuyt’s lion’s head tureens hold a unique place in the international market with the use of skilled, highly trained craftsmen to make the finishing touches. For the largest tureen, the detailed carving of the foot must be done by hand. It takes years of practice to perfect this art and Pillivuyt’s tureens are the only ones in the world to be sculpted in this way. Another unique feature of these tureens is the manual application of the lion’s heads to the outside of the tureen before the final firing. This avoids the problematic indentation found on the inside of other manufacturers’ versions of this bowl – and creates a much more elegant and finely detailed look. Pillivuyt porcelain is fired at 2550 degrees Fahrenheit, so Pillivuyt dishes can go under the broiler, for a final browning or to add that finishing touch. Straight from the freezer to the oven or microwave, Pillivuyt porcelain won’t break! Pillivuyt porcelain is the finest culinary porcelain in the world. The 3.5 Quart, Lion's Head Tureen with Lid epitomizes Pillivuyt's exceptional quality and detail. Use this classic on the dinner table with your finest china.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wbvYcLIQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pillivuyt","source_asin":"B000YM21Q0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-223202","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000YM21Q0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000YM21Q0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":223203,"name":"Picture Peddler Twinkle Love by Jo Moulton Saying Kid Children Child Nursery Animal Elephant Print Poster 12x16","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LpW6JFdgL._AC_.jpg","description":"Quality Art Print Direct From Publisher","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LpW6JFdgL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Picture Peddler","source_asin":"B01609S196","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-223203","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01609S196","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01609S196","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":223204,"name":"Homesick Candle Scented, Arkansas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619kexhTq9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description There’s a feeling that exists within every state, small town or city – an energy all its own. The smell of the air, the sounds of the morning and the memories that reside there can fill us with nostalgia when we return or rifle through mementos. These places exist in our memories, and though life often relocates us, the sentiment for our experience there remains. From the Manufacturer Bring home to you, no matter where you are Using input from locals in various states, we crafted scents that embody those places and bring us back home. Homesick’s hand-poured candles began as a hobby in our kitchen, and to this day we still create each unique candle by hand, one by one. States, Cities, Countries and Memories Whether it’s the seabreezes of Southern California, the distinctive scents of spring days in Central Park in NYC or the vibrance of the energy that pulses through Brasil we have you covered. Books Scent: The main theme is an older leather bound book accord mixed with a woody desk character of cedar and sandalwood. Hints of balsamic and vanilla finish the complex scent. Grandmas Kitchen Table Scent: The scents of rich butter mixed with touches of apple, cinnamon, clove and a hint of sugar cookie. Tonka bean and sugar finish out this homey aroma. Summer Camp Scent: Fresh green grass accord with hints of crystal clear lake water, blooming hyacinth found along trails and just a touch of fresh lemon and smoke. Take Me Home Scent is the strongest tie to memory. Inhaling those sweet aromas while your mind immediately travesl back to those carefree days or amazing experienes. Home can mean so many things and it can be in so many places. Homesick Candles allows you bring bring all of those memories with you, no matter where you go! From your childhood state, to the city where you got engaged, to the best vacation ever in Hawaii to that epic Road Trip with your friends. We have a custom scent for all US States, iconic cities, vibrant countries and those memorable experiences. About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Nostalgic, Memories, All-Natural How did you come up with the idea for this product? We were living in NYC and yet all of us were from somewhere else and missing home. In the winter of 2016, we sought out to find a way to keep that place with you, no matter where you live. Homesick’s hand-poured candles began as a hobby in our kitchen, and to this day we still create each unique candle by hand, one by one. Using input from locals in various states, we crafted scents that embody those places and bring us back home. keep that place with you, no matter where you live. What makes your product special? We finely craft custom scents that are tied to places and memories. Nostalgia in the warmth of a candle. What has been the best part of your startup experience? Collaborating with other small businesses and local input. We feel like we've taken a road trip thru the entire USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619kexhTq9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homesick","source_asin":"B06XGKYKMP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-223204","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XGKYKMP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XGKYKMP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":223205,"name":"Disney Kitchen Neoprene Oven Mitts, 2pk - Non-Slip Heat Resistant Oven Gloves, Ideal for Handling Hot Kitchenware-Ideal Kitchen Set with Hanging Loop,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IkrQNEpPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Give your loved ones and friends - or yourself - a practical gift that will bring a little Disney magic into their lives.Disney luxury kitchen textiles offer a new level of quality, durability and style. Our products are built for comfort and long-lasting performance.These adorable Disney Oven Mitts were designed for you to handle pots and pans safely, so you don’t have to worry and can just enjoy cooking!Our Mickey Mouse and Minnie Mouse oven mitts are heat resistant up to 400 degrees F, making them an everyday must when removing a baking tray or cast iron skillet from the ovenCreate your own Minnie Mouse Kitchen with this adorable oven mitt set. These heat resistant gloves protect hands, fingers, and forearms from heat, steam and grease – a perfect hand protector so no more worries of burning your skin. We also find them useful for opening hard-to-open jar lids due to the flexible texture that grips so well. These cooking gloves measure 13.5 x 7 inches.Kitchen tools and gadgets take a beating in the kitchen, so stains are inevitable. To care, simply hand wash and lay flat to dry. They are designed to suit many kitchen decor styles and can be stored neatly in a drawer or hung using the hanging loop. This Disney Textiles Collection offers an array of choices that make the perfect gift for Disney lovers, the men and women in your life than enjoy cooking and baking at home, or to commemorate the special day for the newlywed. Put a smile on the face of everyone who receives one. No matter the occasion; the perfect Mr and Mrs gifts, honeymoon gifts, bridal shower gifts, bridesmaid gifts, gifts for bride, his and hers, engagement gifts, anniversary gifts for couple, newlywed gifts, or \"just because\" present for wife.We hope you enjoy this quality product as we strive to bring you what you need to get the job done! Enjoy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IkrQNEpPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Best Brands","source_asin":"B0B9242P3H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-223205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9242P3H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9242P3H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
