window.products.push({"id":223209,"name":"GLASS RINSER, NSF APPROVED, COMMERCIAL GRADE (NOT PLASTIC) FOR KITCHEN SINKS, 4\" ROUND, NEW WOBBLE PLATE ACTIVATION WITH HAPPINESS GUARANTEE, DESIGNED","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":230.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h088QN7vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DESIGNED BY BARISTAS FOR THE HOME: Designed and Manufactured by Espresso Parts, a proud supplier of America's best cafes and competitive baristas. We're a team of veteran baristas who have been in the cafe supply business for nearly two decades. We only sell products we love and use ourselves! Used in homes, restaurants, and cafes, to quickly rinse baby bottles, wine glasses, travel cups, coffee mugs, or any drinkware from 1\" to 4. 5\" in diameter. DETACHED ACTIVATION PLATE: The wobble plate allows the user to simply change the angle of the vessel as needed to spray the hard to reach corners; Simple one touch (push-down) operations; The detached wobble plate allows for quick removal so the user can wipe the pan dry after each use. EASY TO INSTALL: Installs in a standard kitchen countertop or kitchen sink hole. Easy installation with the included 42 in. supply line and adapter tee for connecting to ⅜” compression water supply valve. Installation: Must have at least 2 inches of space surrounding the installation hole and no more than 2.25 inches from the center of the hole to the sink's edge - ensuring water flow goes into the sink instead of pooling onto your counter. SAFE AND MADE TO LAST: Our reputation for durable, safe and high quality products is why you'll find our products in many of the best cafes, bars and restaurants around the world. RINSER are made of stainless steel. NSF APPROVED. SATISFACTION : We’re certain you'll love your RINSER! But just in case anything goes wrong and you're not 100% happy, simply send us a message and we’ll make it right. Easy as that!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h088QN7vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EspressoParts","source_asin":"B08HVK35NW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-223209","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HVK35NW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HVK35NW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
