window.products.push({"id":223230,"name":"LMONMOO Fluffy Duvet Cover Queen Size, 5 Pcs Tufted Plush Comforter Cover Set, Faux Fur Bedding Sets, Luxury Shaggy Velvet Ultra Soft Cozy Zipper Clos","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VH3Ey1eFL._AC_SL1496_.jpg","description":"[QUALITY MATERIAL]: Fluffy comforter cover is woven from 100% high quality microfiber material, breathable and wrinkles. The durable fabric is not easy to pill after frequent wash. Front and back are made of high density velvet flannel, which feels soft, smooth and comfortable. [UNIQUE DESIGN]: Different from other solid color velvet duvet covers, our cable knitted tufted duvet cover have a unique three-dimensional pattern. The brand-new look reflects your pursuit of luxury and comfort. The full size duvet cover will not only protect your comforter but also add beauty to your bedroom. [MULTI USAGE]:During the colder months, you can tuck your comforter into this luxurious quilt cover and you'll feel the warmth all over your body. In hot seasons, it can be used alone as a bed blanket. This yellow duvet cover is a perfect Christmas and New Year's gift for family and friends.The elegant appearance is suitable for bedroom, guest room, kids room, dormitorie and hotel, etc. [WHAT CAN YOU GET]: This boho bedding set included 1 duvet cover (90\"x 90\"), 2 pillow cases with envelope closure (20\"x26\"), and 2 square pillowcases with zipper closure (20 \"x20\" ). Note: Quilts and sheets are not include. [EASY USE AND CARE]: Our flannel comforter cover has hidden two-way zipper closure for easy opening and closing. 4 corner ties can keep your comforter in right place.Easy care: gentle machine wash in cold water,do not bleach and tumble dry on low. Please do not bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VH3Ey1eFL._AC_SL1496_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LMONMOO","source_asin":"B0BM918RBW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-223230","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM918RBW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM918RBW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
