window.products.push({"id":223466,"name":"Valentines Day Lights Heart Lights Pink Fairy Decor String Lights 10ft 30 LEDs USB Plug in Battery Operated with Remote Scatter Valentine’s Day Bedroo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cV71b91eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【3D Red Heart with Diamond Cut 】 The red heart size is 1x1.1inch, much larger than the other products on the market, So the heart shaped string lights could be clearly distinguished from a certain distance. The heart also has a diamond-like cut surface, which helps the red heart reflect bring light under different angles. 【A Better Decorative Lights of String 】 The red hearts are connected to a copper wire, the wire is durable and thin, unnoticeable and easy to hide. The flexible wire could be bent and sticks to its shape. You can use the lighting heart somewhere very close to people and it looks like glowing red heart without thick stupid cable. 【It Make Great Gift for The People You Love and Loving You 】 We use warm amber LED to light the red heart up to create a warm soft red atmosphere for your Valentine’s day décor. Product come with Jashika designed package. It is neat and lightweight, applies to many different occasions, safe and easy use. It could be a great additional touch to the details of whatever you are prepared for the special day 【Use USB Plug In to Be Environment Friendly】The string of lights are connected to an USB hub to work with an charger, you could save the trouble of purchasing and changing batteries.. Low voltage makes sure the lighting is safe and can be used anywhere indoor or covered outdoor. We included a battery pack in the box in case you want to use the lights portable, 3 AA batteries could offer around 10 hours battery time since we set the light brightness a high level. 【Wireless Remote Control with Multiple Timer and Flicker Function】6 Hrs build-in timer provides automatic shut off (if you turn it on under 6 Hrs timer mode at 3 PM, it will turn off at 9 PM and on again at 3 PM the next day), plus brightness dimmer and flicker function, easy to use and save your batteries. The remote also offer 9 different flicker mode and speed. You can easily control the lights even when it is out of your reach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cV71b91eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JASHIKA","source_asin":"B08PYJXFZX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-223466","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PYJXFZX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PYJXFZX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
