window.products.push({"id":223655,"name":"Bright Zeal 2-Pack 18\" Tall Color Changing Pearl Tree Lights with Remote and Timer Battery Powered - 16 Colors Indoor Multi Colored Tree Lights Table ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RlSC3LlvL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"COLOR CHANGING PEARL TREE LIGHT IS A LIGHT SHOW - Featuring a bonsai style with adjustable branches, this 18\" tall pearl tree light is embellished with 12 big and 24 small LED pearls, lending a stunningly magic look when lit at night or by day. - 16 static color options & 4 color changing modes: FADE (fade synchronously), JUMP (jump synchronously), ASYN FADE (fade asynchronously), ASYN JUMP (jump asynchronously). MODERN STYLISH LOOK WITH ADJUSTABLE BRANCHES - Satisfy your DIY needs with adjustable branches. - Bend the branches and twigs into the shape you like. - Spread the branches apart for a full bloom; or cluster them together for a sleek silhouette. - Truly nice as a centerpiece for tables for a soft, magical effect, or a modern indoor home decor. 24-KEY REMOTE FOR 16 COLORS 4 COLOR CHANGING MODES - Features ON/TIME/OFF switch, SIXTEEN (16) static color options, FOUR (4) color changing modes, 6-hour timer, and SPEED (the color changing speed). - Requires one CR2025 battery (Included) to operate. - Work modes can ALSO be set manually through the Mode Control button on the base of the light. - The tree light has a memory function which remembers the last setting automatically, no need to reset every time. BATTERY POWERED & USB POWERED - Can be battery powered (3 AA batteries are NOT Included) as well as USB powered. - The USB plug is NOT included, as the USB cable works with your existing USB plugs or any standard USB power slots. - Can use rechargeable batteries or USB power for cost-saving. ATTENTION - Only the branches can be manipulated. Please avoid rough or repeated reshaping that could break the wiring. - Indoor Use Recommended - If using outdoors, please place it under a covered area and keep batteries away from water or heat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RlSC3LlvL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bright Zeal","source_asin":"B07L9422VP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-223655","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L9422VP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L9422VP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
