window.products.push({"id":223727,"name":"CH & ME Adhesive Wall Screws Hanging Nails - 8mm 10/Pack Non-Trace No Drilling Transparent Nail_Free Wall Hook |Heavy Duty Waterproof Seamless Screw f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.86,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o-fOj8hWL._AC_.jpg","description":"CH & ME Adhesive Wall Screws Hanging Nails - Non-trace No Drilling Transparent Nail_Free Wall Hook |Heavy Duty Waterproof Seamless Screw for Kitchen Bathroom Storage Room Tile Wall FEATURES 1.Supper powerful adhesion & Strong heavy duty. 2.Thin and Clear & Nice decoration. 3.No drill no screw & Damage free on the wall. 4.Waterproof & Oil-proof. SPECIFICATION Color: Transparent Gross Weight: 220g/0.49lb Material: Stainless steel+PVC+ABS+Glue Stickers nail size: 50mm/1.97”*80mm/3.15” (L*W). Screw rod Length: 6-16mm.(0.24”-0.63”) Packing Specifications: 20 Pcs/Set Package included:No-trace stickers Screw; Screw nut. INSTALLATION STEPS ARE AS FOLLOWS 1. WIPE THE DUST, GREASE ON THE WALL WITH CLEAN SOFT CLOTH AND KEEP IT FULLY DRY. 2. UNCOVER BARRIER FILM ON BOTTOM LAYER. DON'T TOUCH STICKING FACE WITH HAND. 3. POSITION THE POSITION OF STICKING FILM, PASTE THE PATCH AFFIXED TO THE WALL HORIZONTALLY. 4. FLATTEN WITH FORCE TO THE PATCH FROM INSIDE TO OUTSIDE, PRESS EACH REGION TIGHTLY TO EVACUATE THE AIR IN THE STICKING PATCH. 5. THEN INSTALL HANGING RACK AND SCREW NUT. 6. CHECK THAT THE INSTALLATION IS AGAINST THE WALL. KINDLY REMINDER 1. Please pay attention that there are limits on painted walls, otherwise it might damaged your paint. Avoid using on uneven surface, the more smooth the wall, the better the results. 2.This screw can hold up to 6kg. But we'd like to suggest no more than 6kg for holding a long time. 3. Please clean the adhesive surface with water if it has dust covered before installation the hook. 4. Do not use it at temperatures above 80 degrees.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o-fOj8hWL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CH & ME","source_asin":"B09BHYVGVF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-223727","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BHYVGVF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BHYVGVF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":223728,"name":"Crock-Pot Lunch Crock Food Warmer, 20 ounce, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719ShuQrX1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It's lunchtime. Enjoy the comfort of a warm lunch while on-the-go. Portable warming tote holds 20 ounces of food for a satisfying meal while away from home. You can forget the expensive lunch stops and save time and money by conveniently warming leftovers, soups, chili and more wherever you are. Inner container is removable for filling and transporting. When ready, place container in unit, plug in and warm food until it's time for lunch. It's an ideal option at busy offices instead of having to wait your turn at the microwave or for work environments where there is no kitchen available. If you are tired on boring turkey sandwiches or unhealthy fast foods, the Crock-Pot Lunch Crock Food Warmer provides a new choice for any meal. Leave unit at work and transport spill-proof container from home. Also features carry handle, wrap cord and dishwasher-safe container and lid. Magenta/blue.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719ShuQrX1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crock-Pot","source_asin":"B00CEILYAG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-223728","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CEILYAG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CEILYAG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
