window.products.push({"id":223826,"name":"Electric Lunch Box Food Warmer, 60W Faster Heating Food Lunch Boxes 12V 24V 110V 3 in1 Portable Microwave for Car Truck & Home Hot Meals Boxes Heater,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dNt1z8lFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍱【Healthy & Warm Meal Anywhere】: The electric lunch box is made of BPA free PP plastic and 304 stainless steel, 1.5L large capacity. No microwave required. It supports 110V home / office use, and 12V / 24V car / truck use. Always on the GO and tired of cold or fast food? Now simply plug in and heat up your food with the heated lunch box. And then enjoy your warm & healthier homemade food. 🍱【60W Faster Heating】: The food warmer lunch box upgrade from 40W to 60W heating chip, using PTC original constant temperature heating, the use of a more safe and heat insulation dual function. The heating process takes about 15-40 minutes(Heating time depends on food capacity,type,and temperature). Note: Please do not add liquld to the base of the lunch box to avoid short circuit 🍱【3 in 1】: The Food warmer lunch box kit includes 1 x lunch box, 1 x additional PP compartment for fruits or food storage, 1x SS spoon & fork, 1x high quality thermal insulated carry bag, 1 x 12V/24V 29.5in power cord for cars/trucks and 1x 110V 29.5in for home/office use and 1 x Scrub Sponge. Car / trucker drivers can eat home cooked warm meal healthily on the go, students and office workers can enjoy hot meal at school or in office. 🍱【Portable & Easy to Clean】: The travel portable lunch box is portable and light-weight, coming with a insulated carry bag, 304 stainless steel removable container and a cleaning scrub sponge which is easy to clean and dishwasher safe. Note: Please do not wash external lunch box with water. 🍱【3 Compartments】- Two compartments of stainless steel container with an additional PP Compartment to hold a nutritious and delicious choice of different foods while keeping juices and flavors effectively separated. No mixed odor, healthier and more delicious. 🍱【Why Choose Us】: The spoon & fork storage box at the top of the lunch box can also be used as a mobile phone holder.You can watch a movie while enjoy your meals. Premium quality, fastening buckles design, leak-proof sealing, portable & foldable handles...Whether you’re looking for the perfect gift for you husband, boyfriend, family and friends or for yourself while on the go, look no further and add this thermal lunch box to CART.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dNt1z8lFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aynaxcol","source_asin":"B09QMBD3Z4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-223826","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QMBD3Z4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QMBD3Z4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
