window.products.push({"id":223976,"name":"XQIGI Hair Tool Organizer, Acrylic Hair Dryer Styling Organizers,Clear Bathroom Blow Dryer Stand Holder with 2 Cups and Pearls, Countertop Storage for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MZdR5GJuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MULTIFUNCTIONAL HAIR STYLING ORGANIZER - This storage box organize and store the hair dryer, curling iron, flat iron, straightener, blow dryer very neatly. At the same time, it can also keep your makeup and jewelry cosmetics, lotions, brow pencil, brushes, combs, toiletries, perfume, etc. SAFE COOLING TOOL - The XQIGI hair product organizer storage contains 2 heat resistant stainless steel cups, which can be blow dryer, hot iron, hair straightener holder and curler holder. Providing a safe stand to quickly cool these hair hot tools , store them safely without worrying about melting other accessories. The cups are carved and branded \"XQIGI\" , which can be uesd as wash cups after cleaning. EXQUISITE MAKEUP BRUSH HOLDER - Present about 1000 pcs Beads. They look gorgeous when your makeup brushes, eyebrow pencils, and eyeliners are placed on the pearls . With our transparent acrylic storage rack, your room, powder room, and bathroom look more vivid and beautiful. CONVENIENT SIDE HOLE - The side openings allow a power strip to be used but be out of the way. You can put the surge protector ring there and place it on your hair tools. Bottom drainage outlet design, even if you put the hair organizer in the bathroom, it can keep clean without water accumulation. STURDY AND DURABLE - Made of premiun acrylic and stainless steel cups. Acrylic and stainless steel material is very strong, features strong water resistance and not be rusty. Widely Used in the bathroom, kitchen, bedroom, powder room, living room, cloakroom. (Reminder: The smell of acrylic glue is normal and will not harm your body. You can place it in a ventilated place for 24 hours and the smell will dissipate naturally.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MZdR5GJuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XQIGI","source_asin":"B0BR3Y5MPL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-223976","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR3Y5MPL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR3Y5MPL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
