window.products.push({"id":223995,"name":"Kitchen Compost Caddy Cabinet Mounted Compost Bin - Pail System with Activated Carbon Filters & Storage for Compost Bags","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ckIjUMmvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The \"Kitchen Compost Caddy\" is a green food waste storage system now in its second generation for 2016. We have happy customers now using our product in well over 45,000 homes and businesses throughout the world since our introduction in 2012. Our food waste collection system provides households and businesses participating in residential composting programs, and gardeners a way to store their composting bin onto the inside of a cabinet door at a convenient height beneath the kitchen counter. Once installed, you are able to lock the lid in the open position with a rare earth magnet mounted to the exterior of vented lid. With a flip of the hand, the neodymium magnet is released from the upper metal support of our bracket and gravity drops the lid closed. The reinforced and rugged 100% virgin plastic compost bucket slides onto the Kitchen Compost Caddy rack and is fully supported in three places: Beneath the bucket by our \"V\" shaped bottom support. (Supports the weight within the bucket) and from the back of the bucket, (2 support tabs affix the bucket to the main horizontal support of our rack). The compost bucket can easily be removed from the rack by sliding it upwards and off the rack for ease of cleaning or emptying. To replace the bucket, simply slide the bucket back over the (2) mounting tabs located on the upper metal bracket support while the bottom of the bucket drops effortlessly into the \"V\" shaped bottom support located at the bottom of our rack system. Includes: storage compartment for compost bags. Strengthened / stronger bucket design for 2016. Improvements include: Positive locking lid closure, Strengthened handle, Bottom grip, Feet added to bucket base: Keeps bucket bottom clean and dry. Capacity: 2 gallon. 2 Bag Hooks, Double Seal on the Vented Lid: Our rugged patented mount is built to last. Manufactured from 16 gauge steel / powder coated with Silver/Grey hammertone finish/made in USA. Mounting screws and 2 carbon filters included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ckIjUMmvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchen Compost Caddy","source_asin":"B00BDSO34M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-223995","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BDSO34M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BDSO34M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":223996,"name":"Vintage Home Office Decor Funny Office Signs 3PCS, Duplex Printed Funny Bar Signs, Waterproof PVC Retro Signs Garage Decor for Man Room Decor, Cubicle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817j6zL6-FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Duplex Printing with Weathered Effects] A distinctive and aesthetically pleasing printing method. Contrasted with single-sided printing signs that can only be viewed from the front, these funny office signs are all printed on both sides. With a carefully designed matte finish and imitative rust effect, the retro room decor achieve that weathered look, without actually being old. You can appreciate them either from the front or from the back, especially when they're hanging in the air. [HD Printing with UV-treated Ink] High-quality printing technology manages to avoid the vintage room decor being blurry or pixelated. Featuring bold white text placed against a black background, these home wall decor have bright colors and high-resolution printing. Additionally, by using UV-treated ink, they are fade-resistant and can be displayed for a long time. Even if there's sunlight on the sign, you don’t need to worry about it getting oxidized and fading. [Waterproof & Rustproof Material] Constructed from reliable PVC material, the cubicle decor signs are enhanced with waterproof and rust-free effects, appropriate for decking out even in rain. Furthermore, compared with tin or metal signs which bend easily, these PVC made bar decor signs are much more flexible and efficient in preventing the signs from being bent accidentally during delivery or use. They are free of any creases and dents. [Multiple Uses] Roled both as cubicle decorations for women desk and as interesting gifts. The phrases on the signs are amusing and sarcastic, offering a funny twist to these retro signs. Funny office decors are humorous and eye-catching, helping personalize the space while adding to the relaxed atmosphere of your place. The retro decor signs also awesome gifts, unique in their humor and old-fashioned look. Maybe it will bring joy to friends and elicit laughs. [Suitable Size and Package] Unlike one single sign, there are 3 office cubicle decors of the same theme in one package. They work well alongside other office door decor or just themselves. Each sign measures 8x12 inches with 4 mounting holes that you can hang in a flash. Simply putting strings or nails through the holes to fix these cool room decors on the wall or door can you add that special retro touch to your bedroom, dormitory, office cubicle, bar, cafe, garage, or anywhere else.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817j6zL6-FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EastLink","source_asin":"B0BLSBNQP5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-223996","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLSBNQP5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLSBNQP5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
